interface_review = "Reviewed the package produced and consumed rows against source declarations and actual chain/native/SDK callers: C token/refusal widths, module versus guest ABI, lease/escrow/usage canonical state, chain inclusion and ICS23 state proofs, sandbox authority, scoped porting storage, generated guest calls and recovery. Native transport disagreements and stale registry declarations are findings; missing contracts/programs.md is not treated as a successful contract check."
requirements_review = "Compared the package acceptance criteria for staticlib exports and 128 sweep bound, mounted module-9 keys, successful included sandbox work, proven lifecycle and final destruction, retired proof dependencies, restore continuity, FFI refusal/panic boundaries, six-item pagination, lxphost proof selection, funding evidence, real AI downstream consumer/reopen and deployment payload budget. This is a source audit; historical failed inventory commands and release guest size are not claimed as executed gates."

