proposal = "In programs/crates/layerx-programs-sandbox/src/snapshot.rs, use tenant authorization only for the outer ownership check, then derive LeaseCapabilities from the activated target for the resumed ABI. Prove restored storage reads and writes and refusals of transfer, event, shared-storage and callee authority after reopen."
