proposal = "Store the producing token with DestroyTerminal in programs/crates/layerx-programs-sandbox/src/host_ffi.rs, validate token and capacity before consumption, and guard the export. Add native ABI assertions for wrong-token reads, undersized retry and valid single consumption."
